Sun Oct 18 09:20:28 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 2.15:
  * 2.14: fix stack buffer overflow on long usernames: the
    login name is now truncated into a LOGIN_NAME_MAX buffer
    instead of strcpy into a 40-byte array
  * 2.15: upstream packaging fixes: install honors
    PREFIX/BINDIR/MANDIR, man page is built from source with
    asciidoctor instead of shipping a prebuilt one
  * Fully spellchecked manual page and assorted
    undefined-behavior fixes (curses/mouse handling, character
    classification, computer-AI state reset on new game)
- Add bs-fix-install-paths.patch: install the binary into BINDIR
  instead of MANDIR and honor DESTDIR in uninstall
- Add bs-fix-gcc15-errors.patch: fix -Wincompatible-pointer-types
  errors with GCC 14 and later
- Spec cleanup: drop Group tag; add missing gcc, make and
  rubygem(asciidoctor) BuildRequires; pass PREFIX at install time
  and build with optflags; README renamed to README.adoc upstream

